    // ── ResNet-50 bottleneck batch-BN LAMB (per-tensor trust ratio) over 8 ACCUMULATED micro-batches train step: every op is pretty(verified AST node) except the constants, the β scalars computed from %aup, the input passthroughs and the marked report-only %loss ──
